{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"b6ee0dc9d36a89a6acf2f3c874a087ec26283217d5e5fbe07df90142776ec190","ja":"和をもって　咲かせてみせます　花咲夜","zh":"以和相聚　定当绽放　花咲夜","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"190e34123a24c0040085f3b7b3f25fd50e05da80c2a20c749c92d36930798c8a","ja":"おふたりのおかげで、満喫できました♪\nさすが、大和撫子の鑑ですね！","zh":"多亏了你们两位，我玩得很尽兴♪\n不愧是大和抚子的典范！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cd22e5a1b131a89428116144bba4fe6b3494a0622c5fc7f88d699a13f593e246","ja":"それに比べて私は教えてもらってばかりで……。\n大和撫子の道はまだまだ遠いです……。","zh":"相比之下，我总是在接受别人的教导……。\n距离成为大和抚子还差得远呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"734588457ee95d4f9545ac213743aa373c8e22c18db6e247d4846f0b30bad982","ja":"エミリーちゃん、私達は、大和撫子であろうとして、\n和のことを教えていたわけではありませんよ～。","zh":"艾米莉，我们教你日本文化，可不是为了让你成为大和抚子哦～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0a8f3a2c159c3b84e4c2993d9013be2519a8756e1355895f15a4fd560936074a","ja":"エミリーちゃんが真剣だったからこそ、\nそれに応えようとしただけですから～。","zh":"正因为艾米莉很认真，我才只是想回应她而已～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3c56db7c3450a7eb8c6b041b2d874f62872178fbb41984e913acc2bdc76bfb58","ja":"その通りです。だから……エミリーさんが、私たちを\n大和撫子にしてくれたと言えるのかもしれません。","zh":"没错。所以……也许可以说，是艾米莉让我们成为了大和抚子。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e2067cd64ad7411b22496c507f75548f1417b9e9c78519c517650189b51e0f93","ja":"え？　そ、そんな……！\n私はただはしゃいでいただけで……。","zh":"咦？才、才不是那样……！\n我只是有点兴奋过头了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"c70ae80705d618b748e784ae7dfa9dc34e4ae21e72c3dfc8b62cee7087c8dfae","ja":"そう見えて、実は補い合っているということです。\n言うなれば……『和をもって花咲夜となす』ですね。","zh":"看起来是那样，其实彼此之间正相互弥补。  \n换句话说……就是“以和为贵，成就『花咲夜』”吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a288b0653b020cb4d0a80927894cb5743a740e269a98ea654cf09b5667b72d79","ja":"『和をもって花咲夜となす』……とっても\n素敵な言葉です♪　またひとつ、勉強になりました！","zh":"“以和为贵，绽放成花咲夜”……真是非常美好的一句话♪ 又学到了一个知识！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d48ff923b14e5bcbbae61bf62c2ae0819f40e5d53da1462fee6dc7819e9a5fa7","ja":"……ふふっ。やはり紬さんはこのユニットの\nまとめ役、お姉さんですね～。","zh":"……呵呵。果然，紬小姐是这个组合的协调者，也是大姐姐呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"53782162543d9cae44ab8cf20546343ea1a66986d7fbe00eb8938bb86f51cd4f","ja":"はい、一番年上ですから！　ふたりとも、\n困ったことがあったらいつでも頼ってくださいね！","zh":"是的，毕竟我是年纪最大的嘛！你们两个要是遇到什么麻烦，随时都可以来找我哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_836.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"07af02eb84f430071e4406051c9c3e3eae97f1d3a3a9c97bc0a2a1866ec3c686","ja":"はい、よろしくお願いします♪　では気持ちも\n高まったところで、お仕事に戻りましょう！","zh":"好的，拜托您了♪ 那么，就趁着干劲高涨，回去工作吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
